WEBVTT

00:01.580 --> 00:02.917
(The tassel crowns the knight.
The sword is snow white.)

00:02.941 --> 00:04.276
(In the silver saddle,
he rides like a shooting star.)

00:04.300 --> 00:07.516
(He kills a man within ten steps.
Invincible he is all the way ahead.)

00:07.540 --> 00:13.100
(He would leave once it's done.
No trace of him is to be found.)

01:26.100 --> 01:31.060
=Sword Snow Stride= (Season 1)

01:31.220 --> 01:34.460
=Episode 33=

02:00.810 --> 02:01.810
Mm?

02:03.060 --> 02:04.911
Why are you glaring at me?

02:04.935 --> 02:06.310
It's not like you to give up.

02:07.885 --> 02:09.420
What makes you think so?

02:09.935 --> 02:11.340
Stubborn as you are,

02:11.635 --> 02:13.285
even after Li Chungang

02:13.560 --> 02:15.900
became an Immortal-on-Earth again,

02:16.185 --> 02:19.335
you wouldn't easily give up
or stop, would you?

02:22.135 --> 02:23.960
Zhang Julu asked me to kill Xu Fengnian.

02:24.310 --> 02:26.310
He's the prime minister, anyway.

02:26.735 --> 02:28.310
How could I explain to him

02:28.635 --> 02:30.315
if I didn't fight Xu Fengnian
in a big way?

02:31.985 --> 02:34.060
So, you were only pretending?

02:34.585 --> 02:35.585
Of course.

02:35.960 --> 02:37.310
Like you said,

02:38.035 --> 02:39.979
if Xu Fengnian is killed,

02:40.310 --> 02:41.310
North Liang

02:41.460 --> 02:43.185
won't let it go.

02:44.410 --> 02:45.580
My sword is over there.

02:53.660 --> 02:55.810
I'll take my leave.

02:59.910 --> 03:01.485
(Dragons Rising from Lake Ding)

03:16.760 --> 03:17.900
No one has come after us.

03:18.135 --> 03:18.687
Come on.

03:18.711 --> 03:20.235
A master like me should
walk straight ahead.

03:20.259 --> 03:20.960
I can't look back.

03:21.035 --> 03:22.260
Or I'll be cowardly.

03:22.740 --> 03:23.939
Amazing, Senior.

03:24.285 --> 03:25.935
You're an Immortal-on-Earth again.

03:26.335 --> 03:28.156
Even Wang Xianzhi
is only in the Celestial Realm.

03:28.180 --> 03:30.020
You're now the best
martial artist, aren't you?

03:31.035 --> 03:32.355
The realm is one thing

03:32.379 --> 03:33.740
while the fight is another.

03:33.885 --> 03:35.511
There're four levels
for masters of the highest rank.

03:35.535 --> 03:37.231
Diamond Realm, Void Realm,
Celestial Realm

03:37.255 --> 03:38.655
as well as Immortal-on-Earth Realm.

03:38.885 --> 03:40.340
In a real fight,

03:40.499 --> 03:41.810
martial arts are decisive.

03:42.060 --> 03:43.260
In a life-and-death fight,

03:43.685 --> 03:44.795
Immortals-on-Earth can't always

03:44.819 --> 03:46.286
defeat the masters
in the other three realms.

03:46.310 --> 03:47.511
Especially Wang Xianzhi.

03:47.535 --> 03:49.235
He can never be judged by the realm.

03:49.259 --> 03:50.819
What's the use of the realms, then?

03:51.485 --> 03:52.355
In different realms,

03:52.379 --> 03:53.356
you have different understandings,

03:53.380 --> 03:55.300
and you take different routes, too.

03:55.539 --> 03:56.539
What routes?

03:56.585 --> 03:58.300
The route downhill, for now.

03:58.735 --> 03:59.735
Fine, then.

03:59.779 --> 04:00.786
Let's not talk about Wang Xianzhi.

04:00.810 --> 04:01.610
How about what just happened?

04:01.760 --> 04:02.740
If you had brandished the swords,

04:02.779 --> 04:04.059
could you wipe out Mount Longhu?

04:04.560 --> 04:06.435
There's always someone better.

04:06.510 --> 04:07.397
Mount Longhu has been

04:07.421 --> 04:09.396
at a stalemate with Double-Zen Temple
for a thousand years.

04:09.420 --> 04:10.740
It has such a long history.

04:11.060 --> 04:13.036
God knows how many old masters
there are on Mount Longhu.

04:13.060 --> 04:13.687
Kid,

04:13.711 --> 04:14.711
you must understand.

04:14.735 --> 04:15.740
The fight between masters

04:15.779 --> 04:17.156
is just like the buffalo fight.

04:17.180 --> 04:18.180
What buffalo fight?

04:18.510 --> 04:19.915
Buffaloes are mighty

04:19.939 --> 04:20.812
with sharp horns.

04:20.836 --> 04:22.460
But when they fight,

04:22.685 --> 04:24.125
they mostly dash against each other.

04:24.335 --> 04:25.785
When one of them wins,

04:26.210 --> 04:27.385
they stop.

04:27.460 --> 04:29.695
You just used the swords
to intimidate them, didn't you?

04:30.285 --> 04:31.596
If we always had life-and-death fights,

04:31.620 --> 04:33.379
how many people could still be alive?

04:33.510 --> 04:34.961
Senior, you're the Immortal-on-Earth.

04:34.985 --> 04:36.535
Can you talk like an immortal?

04:36.735 --> 04:37.735
I can.

04:38.060 --> 04:40.220
The fight between masters

04:40.259 --> 04:41.235
is just like the immortal buffalo fight.

04:41.259 --> 04:42.139
All right. All right.

04:42.180 --> 04:43.276
I understand it.

04:43.300 --> 04:44.162
Say no more.

04:44.186 --> 04:45.259
I can't stand it anymore.

04:51.310 --> 04:52.670
- Senior Danping.
- Senior Danping.

05:02.535 --> 05:04.910
(Zhao Xuansu, founder of Mount Longhu)

05:15.685 --> 05:16.885
We had a tentative fight

05:17.135 --> 05:18.611
and the result was beyond expectation.

05:18.635 --> 05:19.635
Li Chungang

05:20.410 --> 05:23.139
becomes the Immortal-on-Earth again.

05:24.010 --> 05:25.535
Under such circumstances,

05:26.310 --> 05:28.535
you still want to kill Xu Fengnian?

05:29.710 --> 05:30.980
Xu Fengnian has to be killed.

05:32.160 --> 05:33.860
Otherwise, Wudang Sect
would be powerful.

05:34.635 --> 05:35.635
However,

05:36.160 --> 05:38.110
he mustn't be killed on Mount Longhu.

05:38.910 --> 05:40.410
We also can't let anyone suspect

05:40.760 --> 05:42.980
that we're involved in his death.

05:43.180 --> 05:44.360
We won't take the blame

05:45.335 --> 05:46.760
for Xu Xiao's fury.

05:49.260 --> 05:52.259
You're shifting the big trouble to me?

05:53.635 --> 05:54.635
Grandmaster.

05:55.610 --> 05:57.535
You have supreme martial arts

05:58.180 --> 05:59.885
and you look like a boy now.

06:00.560 --> 06:03.315
I'm afraid no one in this world

06:03.339 --> 06:05.235
can recognize you.

06:06.735 --> 06:08.285
You're forcing me to take action?

06:08.685 --> 06:09.685
Grandmaster,

06:10.435 --> 06:12.460
our fortune in the next century

06:12.985 --> 06:14.985
is in your hands.

06:21.635 --> 06:22.635
Grandmaster.

06:23.985 --> 06:25.259
If you don't mind,

06:25.610 --> 06:27.085
please kill one more person.

06:30.760 --> 06:31.986
Who?

06:32.010 --> 06:33.579
The illegitimate son of His Majesty,

06:34.235 --> 06:35.235
Zhao Kai.

06:47.985 --> 06:49.385
It's not the way to Wudi City.

06:53.485 --> 06:55.035
Do you have something to do there?

06:56.635 --> 06:58.161
Didn't the senior who was fishing

06:58.185 --> 06:59.579
ask us to go to Wudi City?

07:00.185 --> 07:01.425
If we want to kill Xu Fengnian,

07:01.835 --> 07:03.499
we don't need to go to Wudi City.

07:03.810 --> 07:04.810
The key

07:05.885 --> 07:07.579
lies in Li Chungang.

07:08.860 --> 07:09.860
Wait.

07:10.760 --> 07:12.499
Senior asked us not to kill Xu Fengnian.

07:24.460 --> 07:26.835
It's a book of secret martial arts
of the Xuanyuan Family.

07:29.935 --> 07:30.935
Where did you get it?

07:31.910 --> 07:33.586
I said I would give you
some books on secret martial arts.

07:33.610 --> 07:35.560
I have to keep my promise.

07:36.585 --> 07:38.499
Senior doesn't want to kill Xu Fengnian

07:38.735 --> 07:40.156
in case the world falls into chaos

07:40.180 --> 07:41.485
and wars break out again.

07:45.935 --> 07:46.935
You're not afraid?

07:47.510 --> 07:48.510
I am.

07:52.060 --> 07:53.340
But if the world isn't in chaos,

07:54.135 --> 07:55.560
how can I find a way out?

07:55.935 --> 07:58.110
Without a way out,
how can I give you a bright future?

07:58.435 --> 07:59.435
Yuan Tingshan,

07:59.935 --> 08:01.636
you've been seeking a chance.

08:01.660 --> 08:02.699
But you must understand.

08:04.135 --> 08:05.699
Without a tremendous change,

08:07.035 --> 08:09.185
you can get no chance to alter destiny.

08:17.935 --> 08:18.985
If you're scared,

08:19.760 --> 08:20.935
you can leave right away.

08:28.259 --> 08:29.810
How can we defeat Li Chungang?

08:31.035 --> 08:32.360
Let's wait for a friend of mine.

08:33.260 --> 08:34.260
Who?

08:34.960 --> 08:36.360
Who can deal with the God of Sword?

08:40.510 --> 08:41.510
Here she comes.

08:54.235 --> 08:55.739
She once hunted me down.

09:01.960 --> 09:03.540
I want you to do me a favor.

09:04.535 --> 09:05.535
Why must I help you?

09:06.735 --> 09:08.375
For White Emperor
Esoterica of Simplicity.

09:12.360 --> 09:13.361
How do you know I want that?

09:13.385 --> 09:14.810
I saw you fight.

09:16.410 --> 09:18.610
Judged from your martial arts,

09:18.960 --> 09:20.300
you're from Nanjiang.

09:21.785 --> 09:23.110
Martial artists from Nanjiang

09:23.560 --> 09:25.579
do crafty and variable martial arts.

09:25.910 --> 09:27.979
But without White Emperor
Esoterica of Simplicity,

09:28.385 --> 09:30.500
when they only practice with blades,

09:31.185 --> 09:33.285
they'll all go insane at last.

09:33.885 --> 09:34.885
Am I right?

09:35.135 --> 09:37.236
No matter whether you want
to build up a sect

09:37.260 --> 09:38.516
or inherit your original sect,

09:38.540 --> 09:39.710
you need it.

09:41.110 --> 09:42.335
I can give it to you.

09:49.060 --> 09:51.236
Neither of you shall run about again,

09:51.260 --> 09:52.260
especially you.

09:52.285 --> 09:53.310
Do you hear me?

09:53.810 --> 09:54.810
Your Highness.

09:58.210 --> 09:59.010
What's up?

09:59.210 --> 10:00.935
I'm General Ning Emei
of Fengzi Battalion.

10:01.335 --> 10:02.735
I came to apologize, Your Highness.

10:03.960 --> 10:04.985
I want...

10:06.910 --> 10:08.710
I want to keep escorting His Highness.

10:08.885 --> 10:10.156
That's what you're supposed to do.

10:10.180 --> 10:11.960
But I used to support you.

10:12.185 --> 10:13.185
Support me?

10:13.485 --> 10:14.936
Born with extraordinary power,

10:14.960 --> 10:16.000
you're incomparably brave.

10:16.235 --> 10:17.795
I thought His Highness was incompetent.

10:17.985 --> 10:18.796
So, I decided

10:18.820 --> 10:20.661
to support you
in taking over North Liang.

10:20.685 --> 10:21.685
What's your decision now?

10:23.160 --> 10:24.160
Now...

10:24.760 --> 10:26.200
When escorting him all the way here,

10:27.035 --> 10:28.035
I think...

10:28.260 --> 10:29.260
Think what?

10:31.685 --> 10:32.960
I think His Highness

10:33.860 --> 10:35.020
will be a wise ruler.

10:39.110 --> 10:40.110
I'm glad to hear that.

10:40.460 --> 10:42.061
North Liang belongs to my brother.

10:42.085 --> 10:43.125
No one can take it away.

10:43.810 --> 10:44.610
Your Highness...

10:44.735 --> 10:45.864
Nor can I.

10:53.410 --> 10:55.385
You don't need to fight Xu Fengnian.

10:56.560 --> 10:58.210
I won't put you in a tight spot.

11:05.635 --> 11:06.915
What do you want me to do, then?

11:10.085 --> 11:11.560
I want to meet Li Chungang.

11:36.910 --> 11:38.099
Don't. Don't.

11:39.285 --> 11:41.500
I'll leave my brother to you.

11:42.485 --> 11:45.060
My disciple is the most precious.

11:45.160 --> 11:46.760
Rest assured, Your Highness.

11:47.085 --> 11:48.535
For what you just said,

11:48.710 --> 11:50.235
no matter what happens in the future,

11:50.335 --> 11:52.579
I'll leave a ray of hope for your sect.

11:53.660 --> 11:55.579
Fengnian, I climbed all the trees.

11:55.935 --> 11:56.985
These are the ripest.

12:00.385 --> 12:01.699
Fengnian, the hawthorns dropped.

12:01.760 --> 12:02.760
They dropped.

12:17.135 --> 12:18.435
Where's Shu Xiu?

12:20.510 --> 12:21.579
Hasn't she embarked?

12:22.635 --> 12:23.635
She hasn't.

12:24.185 --> 12:25.285
There she is.

12:30.660 --> 12:31.660
Where were you?

12:33.385 --> 12:34.425
I just took a walk around.

12:38.310 --> 12:38.960
Hey.

12:39.235 --> 12:40.300
Did you see Senior Wei?

12:40.835 --> 12:41.835
No.

12:42.500 --> 12:43.579
That's weird.

12:44.385 --> 12:45.780
He hasn't embarked, I guess.

12:46.685 --> 12:49.459
Maybe he's looking for a place to sleep.

12:56.085 --> 12:57.445
Shall I send some men to find him?

12:59.160 --> 13:00.160
No, don't bother.

13:03.585 --> 13:04.585
Done.

13:04.610 --> 13:05.610
Done.

13:05.960 --> 13:07.000
The hawthorns taste great.

13:08.610 --> 13:09.610
Wait a minute.

13:32.635 --> 13:33.660
Keep it.

13:37.140 --> 13:37.862
But,

13:37.886 --> 13:39.180
won't it feel lonely

13:39.535 --> 13:40.855
if it stays away from its sister?

13:41.910 --> 13:43.660
Family members will meet again.

13:43.960 --> 13:45.060
Protect it carefully.

13:45.235 --> 13:46.635
I'll wait until you come back home.

13:46.935 --> 13:47.935
Mm.

13:48.710 --> 13:51.694
Does Master know about the assassination

13:52.185 --> 13:54.180
against Xu Fengnian and Zhao Kai?

13:55.010 --> 13:56.735
Master is in the zone.

14:02.635 --> 14:04.660
You're daring.

14:05.699 --> 14:07.180
Thank you for the help, Grandmaster.

14:08.660 --> 14:09.939
I'm not only helping you.

14:10.285 --> 14:12.010
I'm struggling to live, too.

14:18.585 --> 14:20.860
I look like a boy.

14:21.585 --> 14:24.885
But inside my body, I'm exhausted.

14:25.219 --> 14:26.935
I'll die soon.

14:27.485 --> 14:28.485
Grandmaster,

14:28.860 --> 14:30.210
how come?

14:31.235 --> 14:32.739
I can't live,

14:33.660 --> 14:35.835
unless I become an immortal.

14:39.560 --> 14:42.760
If Li Chungang and Wang Xianzhi
have a fight,

14:43.485 --> 14:45.459
it'll be sublime.

14:46.660 --> 14:49.285
I may have a chance
to knock open the Heaven's Gate

14:50.435 --> 14:52.540
and find the last hope.

14:53.610 --> 14:54.835
Grandmaster,

14:55.619 --> 14:57.819
hope you'll find the way
to become an immortal.

14:58.985 --> 15:00.285
Here I go.

15:00.935 --> 15:01.935
Grandmaster,

15:03.085 --> 15:04.180
are you going

15:04.485 --> 15:05.885
to stalk them?

15:08.310 --> 15:10.110
I'm going to board the ship

15:10.510 --> 15:12.660
and travel with Xu Fengnian.

15:12.960 --> 15:16.235
But how can you sneak
onto Xu Fengnian's ship?

15:20.960 --> 15:22.610
By haunting them shamelessly.

16:19.710 --> 16:20.735
You didn't stay?

16:34.560 --> 16:35.560
You may rise.

16:36.985 --> 16:40.060
A North Liang soldier salutes,
but doesn't kneel.

16:42.060 --> 16:42.761
Your Highness,

16:42.785 --> 16:43.785
I used to be stupid.

16:44.460 --> 16:45.860
You're the future of North Liang.

16:47.560 --> 16:49.619
Not until I'm back to North Liang alive.

16:51.935 --> 16:52.935
Your Highness,

16:53.185 --> 16:54.265
there's a ship ahead of us.

17:05.860 --> 17:07.560
It belongs to the Xuanyuan Family, too.

17:32.935 --> 17:34.716
I've got something to talk to him about.

17:34.740 --> 17:36.410
You go back to your cabins for a rest.

17:36.685 --> 17:37.685
Go.

17:53.385 --> 17:54.385
Come out.

18:14.410 --> 18:15.760
We made a deal.

18:17.610 --> 18:18.910
When I leave Mount Longhu,

18:19.460 --> 18:20.935
you should go west.

18:21.435 --> 18:22.460
I remember.

18:25.610 --> 18:26.835
That's the ship for you.

18:27.210 --> 18:28.486
When you board another ship
on the river,

18:28.510 --> 18:29.635
you won't be noticed.

18:31.985 --> 18:32.985
Mm.

18:33.485 --> 18:34.485
Good plan.

19:00.260 --> 19:01.611
Since Liyang was founded,

19:01.635 --> 19:02.985
there has been chaos in Shu.

19:05.060 --> 19:07.060
Fierce armies and bandits
rise from all directions.

19:08.435 --> 19:10.761
Most of them are veterans of Chu

19:10.785 --> 19:12.885
who went to Shu for shelter.

19:14.735 --> 19:15.810
I know that.

19:17.710 --> 19:18.836
Even if you're the princess,

19:18.860 --> 19:20.595
you can't easily persuade those people

19:20.619 --> 19:21.619
to work for you.

19:21.935 --> 19:23.685
The kindness of the royal family of Chu

19:24.135 --> 19:26.485
has been worn away, I'm afraid.

19:26.910 --> 19:28.110
Mr. Chess Master will help me.

19:28.585 --> 19:29.595
I don't think Cao Changqing

19:29.619 --> 19:30.960
can guard you day and night.

19:31.285 --> 19:32.735
You must be very careful.

19:36.785 --> 19:37.785
Mm.

20:59.135 --> 21:00.261
Here's the second ship you asked for.

21:00.285 --> 21:01.285
And the pigeons.

21:01.585 --> 21:02.960
Wei Shuyang told me.

21:03.335 --> 21:04.811
The pigeons are in the freight cabin.

21:04.835 --> 21:05.812
When you need to send a message,

21:05.836 --> 21:06.886
fly more pigeons

21:06.910 --> 21:07.960
in case of accidents.

21:08.385 --> 21:09.736
The sailors are all experienced.

21:09.760 --> 21:11.400
They only know
she's heading for West Shu,

21:11.860 --> 21:13.099
but don't know who she is.

21:13.785 --> 21:14.785
Thank you.

21:18.579 --> 21:19.579
You're welcome.

21:19.660 --> 21:20.935
We owe you.

21:22.085 --> 21:23.155
I'll wait for your message

21:23.179 --> 21:24.179
about what you want next.

21:24.860 --> 21:26.485
I heard that your mother died, too.

21:28.885 --> 21:30.235
She died to accompany my father.

21:31.810 --> 21:32.810
Their relationship...

21:34.135 --> 21:35.685
I've never understood that.

21:36.235 --> 21:37.235
I'm sorry for your loss.

21:40.810 --> 21:41.961
If you don't mind,

21:41.985 --> 21:43.035
I'll take my leave.

21:43.160 --> 21:44.735
If trouble occurs on Mount Hui,

21:44.860 --> 21:47.060
you and your family can come
to North Liang for shelter.

22:00.910 --> 22:03.060
She's different from what she was
when we first met.

22:03.860 --> 22:05.085
What happened has changed her.

22:20.910 --> 22:22.390
Time for me to get to the other ship.

22:38.010 --> 22:39.010
Senior Li,

22:39.085 --> 22:40.085
I'll take my leave.

22:40.860 --> 22:41.860
Oh.

22:43.410 --> 22:44.940
I'll go visit you in West Shu.

22:46.010 --> 22:46.810
What for?

22:46.985 --> 22:48.025
I'll make you my disciple.

22:48.310 --> 22:49.885
He's already your disciple, isn't he?

22:50.860 --> 22:52.085
He uses the blades.

22:52.510 --> 22:54.210
You're more suited to my swordsmanship.

22:56.135 --> 22:57.135
We'll see.

22:57.485 --> 22:58.685
I haven't made up my mind yet.

23:00.835 --> 23:01.835
Take your time.

25:17.835 --> 25:18.960
My job is done.

25:19.210 --> 25:20.250
I'll go back to that ship.

25:21.735 --> 25:22.735
Thank you.

25:23.135 --> 25:24.635
His Highness sent me.

26:07.110 --> 26:08.110
Your Grace.

26:08.885 --> 26:10.110
It's been years.

26:11.510 --> 26:13.235
I never expected

26:13.535 --> 26:15.960
that I could be the princess again.

26:17.485 --> 26:18.437
Mr. Chess Master,

26:18.461 --> 26:19.579
let's go.

26:23.460 --> 26:24.710
Did I say anything wrong?

26:29.110 --> 26:30.555
No. Your conversation isn't over yet.

26:30.579 --> 26:32.099
What does that mean?

26:32.385 --> 26:33.410
What's he up to?

26:52.385 --> 26:53.700
What are you coming for?

26:56.185 --> 26:57.185
This is for you.

27:00.935 --> 27:02.635
Why did you give this to me?

27:04.110 --> 27:05.110
It's a gift for you.

27:05.635 --> 27:06.760
Are you out of your mind?

27:06.860 --> 27:08.835
It was your mother's sword!

27:14.285 --> 27:15.285
Mr. Cao,

27:15.460 --> 27:16.410
shall we

27:16.460 --> 27:18.160
leave them alone?

27:23.535 --> 27:24.885
After they part today,

27:25.085 --> 27:27.125
they don't know
when they can meet each other again.

27:43.585 --> 27:44.585
Here.

27:45.985 --> 27:46.985
We made a deal.

27:47.110 --> 27:48.230
I pay you for reading books.

27:49.010 --> 27:50.611
But it's been days
since I read last time.

27:50.635 --> 27:52.260
It's the deposit for the next time.

27:55.360 --> 27:56.916
God knows when we'll meet again.

27:56.940 --> 27:58.035
I don't care.

27:58.135 --> 27:59.135
I just reserve it.

28:00.610 --> 28:02.179
I'm the princess now.

28:02.335 --> 28:03.335
I'll charge more.

28:06.610 --> 28:07.410
The price will be doubled.

28:07.610 --> 28:08.610
Two coins for one word.

28:09.935 --> 28:10.935
That's acceptable.

28:18.985 --> 28:20.935
Do you also like Xu Fengnian?

28:23.285 --> 28:24.785
That's not true.

28:29.560 --> 28:31.110
You're nearly strangling the cat.

28:38.735 --> 28:39.735
Mr. Cao,

28:40.035 --> 28:41.099
don't talk nonsense

28:42.085 --> 28:43.235
about this stuff.

29:44.860 --> 29:45.860
Your Grace.

29:49.335 --> 29:50.335
Time to go.

29:52.085 --> 29:53.085
I see.

29:58.585 --> 29:59.585
Mr. Cao,

30:00.135 --> 30:01.560
could you do me a favor?

30:02.110 --> 30:03.110
What is it?

30:03.260 --> 30:04.485
When you're going west,

30:04.835 --> 30:06.460
can you hype your voyage?

30:06.835 --> 30:07.910
So that people will know

30:08.260 --> 30:10.540
Her Grace and I are going to West Shu?

30:10.785 --> 30:11.785
That's right.

30:12.110 --> 30:12.735
I can do that.

30:13.060 --> 30:14.900
They can be prepared
to welcome Her Grace, too.

30:17.685 --> 30:18.685
Thank you.

30:18.985 --> 30:20.085
Wish you

30:20.285 --> 30:21.060
a happy voyage.

30:21.235 --> 30:22.235
Xu Fengnian,

30:22.485 --> 30:24.085
have you thought about
how you'll end up?

30:27.835 --> 30:28.985
Be specific, please.

30:29.385 --> 30:30.905
You're the son of Lord of North Liang.

30:31.085 --> 30:32.860
You're destined to defend the world.

30:33.610 --> 30:34.810
Her Grace is going

30:35.335 --> 30:36.735
to draw in our former subordinates.

30:36.910 --> 30:38.760
She's getting back
to West Chu, after all.

30:39.835 --> 30:41.139
I'm afraid when you meet again,

30:41.260 --> 30:42.619
you'll meet on the battleground.

30:43.135 --> 30:44.685
This is how you'll end up.

30:46.110 --> 30:47.285
It won't happen, Mr. Cao.

30:48.510 --> 30:49.510
I never

30:49.710 --> 30:51.500
take any route arranged by others.

30:52.285 --> 30:53.585
When that day comes,

30:56.285 --> 30:57.285
trust me.

30:58.510 --> 30:59.710
I'll defend the world and you.

31:01.510 --> 31:02.510
Defend the world and her?

31:03.435 --> 31:04.660
It's a tough job.

31:10.185 --> 31:11.665
Where there's a will, there is a way.

31:15.610 --> 31:16.740
I'll wait and see, then.

31:17.760 --> 31:18.760
Off you go.

31:22.560 --> 31:23.800
So, you're taking the cat, too?

31:25.260 --> 31:26.710
Don't waste your time on me.

31:26.885 --> 31:28.685
Talk to Her Grace
if you have anything to say.

31:30.485 --> 31:31.485
We're done talking.

31:31.835 --> 31:33.035
Our conversation will continue

31:33.160 --> 31:34.160
when we meet again.

31:34.360 --> 31:35.985
Two coins for one word by then.

31:38.610 --> 31:39.610
All right.

31:40.435 --> 31:41.560
It's a deal.

32:13.360 --> 32:14.760
You simply had such a short talk?

32:16.935 --> 32:18.835
He even gave you

32:18.859 --> 32:19.859
his mother's sword.

32:20.235 --> 32:21.819
But you didn't respond.

32:27.960 --> 32:28.960
Trust me.

32:29.485 --> 32:30.725
I can defend the world and you.

32:32.419 --> 32:33.819
Two coins for one word by then.

32:35.435 --> 32:36.579
It's a deal.

33:14.735 --> 33:16.375
If you send a message
back to North Liang,

33:17.360 --> 33:18.760
she can still be stopped.

33:20.960 --> 33:21.960
Grandpa Wei,

33:22.710 --> 33:24.360
she's got her own way to go.

33:26.860 --> 33:28.460
I'm glad you let go of her.

33:30.410 --> 33:32.450
We don't get something
unless we first let go of it.

33:32.560 --> 33:33.560
Only after we part

33:34.985 --> 33:36.185
can we meet again.

33:39.160 --> 33:40.835
When she's away, you sound grieved.

33:41.110 --> 33:42.610
It's just my true feeling.

33:45.685 --> 33:46.960
What's that on your head?

33:47.960 --> 33:48.960
My hair.

33:49.535 --> 33:50.660
What's in your hair?

33:51.860 --> 33:52.860
Oh.

33:53.985 --> 33:54.985
It's for you.

33:55.160 --> 33:56.260
The Divine Token?

33:57.685 --> 33:58.835
Before Jiang Ni left,

33:58.859 --> 34:00.540
she asked me to give it to you.

34:00.835 --> 34:02.611
But it's the national heirloom
of West Chu!

34:02.635 --> 34:03.956
You also gave her
Daliang Dragon Sparrow,

34:03.980 --> 34:04.810
didn't you?

34:04.885 --> 34:05.875
She gave you the Divine Token

34:05.899 --> 34:07.036
and you gave her Daliang Dragon Sparrow.

34:07.060 --> 34:09.219
How lavish you both are!

34:16.210 --> 34:17.210
Your Highness,

34:18.585 --> 34:19.699
what is

34:20.035 --> 34:21.219
our next stop?

34:25.935 --> 34:27.185
Shangyin Academy.

35:01.335 --> 35:03.286
Aren't we going to Wudi City
to wait for Xu Fengnian?

35:03.310 --> 35:05.160
He's going to Shangyin Academy.

35:05.510 --> 35:06.659
After he left North Liang,

35:06.735 --> 35:08.375
he visited Xu Zhihu in Jiangnan

35:08.410 --> 35:09.715
and Xu Longxiang on Mount Longhu.

35:09.739 --> 35:10.835
Don't you think

35:11.060 --> 35:12.935
he's going to visit my wife?

35:14.260 --> 35:15.535
Who's your wife?

35:15.810 --> 35:16.810
Xu Weixiong.

35:17.110 --> 35:18.510
Xu Fengnian's second eldest sister.

35:18.560 --> 35:19.555
You're his brother-in-law.

35:19.579 --> 35:20.436
Then why do you want to kill him?

35:20.460 --> 35:21.460
He doesn't know that.

35:21.560 --> 35:23.260
He doesn't know
you're his brother-in-law?

35:23.485 --> 35:24.810
Few people know that.

35:25.560 --> 35:26.800
His sister hasn't told him yet?

35:31.560 --> 35:33.040
His sister doesn't know that, either.

35:34.410 --> 35:35.212
Wait.

35:35.236 --> 35:36.996
She doesn't know that, either?

35:37.020 --> 35:38.020
What doesn't she know?

35:38.735 --> 35:40.185
She doesn't know

35:40.935 --> 35:42.460
she's my wife.

35:43.260 --> 35:44.610
Aren't you extorting it?

35:45.210 --> 35:46.660
She'll be my wife sooner or later.

35:47.685 --> 35:50.160
Only a remarkable lady like Xu Weixiong

35:51.060 --> 35:53.310
can be my wife.

35:54.185 --> 35:56.085
Then why do you want
to kill her brother?

35:56.710 --> 35:58.436
North Liang won't fall into chaos
unless Xu Fengnian is killed.

35:58.460 --> 36:00.195
Only when there's chaos
can I distinguish myself.

36:00.219 --> 36:02.396
By then, I'll be qualified
to marry Xu Weixiong.

36:02.420 --> 36:03.660
So,

36:04.310 --> 36:05.860
I want to kill Xu Fengnian

36:06.460 --> 36:07.785
because I want Xu Weixiong.

36:10.035 --> 36:11.910
I really want to see

36:12.035 --> 36:13.311
what kind of a remarkable lady

36:13.335 --> 36:15.185
can be a good match for you.

36:46.635 --> 36:51.135
(Xu Xiao is my father. Hello, Brother.)

36:56.385 --> 36:57.385
Look.

36:57.785 --> 37:04.411
(Xu Xiao is my father. Hello, Brother.)

37:04.435 --> 37:05.739
What's going on?

37:07.420 --> 37:09.010
My mother said

37:09.385 --> 37:10.811
that she met my father

37:10.835 --> 37:12.336
when he was fighting influential clans

37:12.360 --> 37:14.435
throughout the nation.

37:14.585 --> 37:16.970
They had love affairs.

37:17.460 --> 37:19.385
But she never regretted it.

37:19.835 --> 37:20.835
Brother.

37:21.835 --> 37:24.960
We meet at last, Brother!

37:29.099 --> 37:31.385
You're saying Xu Xiao is your father?

37:31.660 --> 37:33.020
I can hardly believe that, either.

37:33.360 --> 37:34.436
I came to you

37:34.460 --> 37:36.900
so that I can go back to North Liang
and figure out the truth.

37:37.260 --> 37:38.620
Why didn't you come to me earlier?

37:38.810 --> 37:40.356
My mother didn't tell me

37:40.380 --> 37:42.786
who my father was.

37:42.810 --> 37:44.585
Why did she tell you at last?

37:44.985 --> 37:46.299
She told me about it

37:46.435 --> 37:48.476
before she died of a serious disease.

37:48.585 --> 37:49.609
She's dead?

37:50.510 --> 37:51.835
I'm still in mourning.

37:52.485 --> 37:53.735
She just passed away?

37:54.385 --> 37:56.885
I buried her not long ago!

38:02.860 --> 38:04.360
What a coincidence!

38:05.560 --> 38:06.560
Shu Xiu.

38:15.635 --> 38:16.715
He doesn't do martial arts.

38:18.985 --> 38:21.085
If you don't want me
to go to North Liang,

38:21.310 --> 38:22.935
I won't go.

38:23.935 --> 38:26.135
You don't need to kill me.

38:29.710 --> 38:30.760
What's your name?

38:31.235 --> 38:32.310
Long Yuxuan.

38:33.110 --> 38:34.635
Call me Xiaochong.

38:35.060 --> 38:36.060
Long is your family name?

38:36.660 --> 38:37.210
Mm.

38:37.335 --> 38:38.610
It's my mother's family name.

38:42.110 --> 38:43.585
Arrange a room for him.

38:45.385 --> 38:46.340
Thank you, Brother!

38:46.380 --> 38:47.660
It's so nice of you, Brother.

38:47.960 --> 38:49.135
It's so nice of you.

38:49.260 --> 38:50.260
Brother.

38:51.110 --> 38:52.161
Brother.

38:52.185 --> 38:53.385
I'll arrange the room for him.

38:56.610 --> 38:57.660
Thank you, Miss.

38:57.885 --> 38:58.916
You're so strong.

38:58.940 --> 38:59.685
Stop talking rubbish.

38:59.760 --> 39:00.760
Come with me.

39:01.735 --> 39:02.735
Thank you, Brother.

39:08.160 --> 39:09.385
Thank you, Brother.

39:14.660 --> 39:15.715
Let's see what he'll do

39:15.739 --> 39:16.836
after he's on board.

39:16.860 --> 39:17.860
Mm.

39:42.210 --> 39:43.885
Miss Shu, you have good martial arts

39:44.085 --> 39:44.739
and you're nice.

39:45.010 --> 39:46.010
You're beautiful, too.

39:46.885 --> 39:48.686
If I can be your disciple,

39:48.710 --> 39:50.235
I'll even laugh in my dream.

40:04.635 --> 40:05.835
Let me stay and accompany you.

40:16.960 --> 40:18.611
Miss Qingniao, it's windy.

40:18.635 --> 40:20.085
Shall I hold the spear for you?

40:22.160 --> 40:22.685
You...

40:22.860 --> 40:24.110
Give it to me.

40:24.685 --> 40:25.685
No, thanks.

40:28.010 --> 40:29.659
Let me accompany you for a while.

40:38.435 --> 40:39.162
Brother, are you tired?

40:39.186 --> 40:40.626
Shall I give you a shoulder massage?

40:42.035 --> 40:43.035
No.

40:43.335 --> 40:44.560
I can do the leg massage, too.

40:46.060 --> 40:47.060
What else can you do?

40:47.635 --> 40:49.139
I can do some simple cooking.

40:49.210 --> 40:50.730
If you get some fish, I can cook them.

40:50.935 --> 40:51.935
And?

40:52.060 --> 40:53.060
And...

40:53.210 --> 40:54.860
According to my mother,

40:54.900 --> 40:56.186
boys are hot enough to heat pancakes.

40:56.210 --> 40:57.436
In the evening,

40:57.460 --> 40:58.610
I can make your quilt warm

40:58.910 --> 41:00.185
before you go to bed.

41:00.485 --> 41:02.011
Then you'll leave some pancakes in it?

41:02.035 --> 41:03.035
No.

41:03.685 --> 41:04.876
That's just a proverb.

41:04.900 --> 41:05.900
Go away.

41:06.260 --> 41:07.885
I'll leave the apple to you, then.

41:13.935 --> 41:15.710
He's such a chatterbox.

41:15.985 --> 41:18.385
He has got familiar
with everyone on the ship.

41:19.160 --> 41:20.735
Do you think what he said is true?

41:20.835 --> 41:23.120
How did he know
where your ship would pass?

41:25.285 --> 41:26.736
You're quite sharp-eyed.

41:26.760 --> 41:27.636
It was an odd coincidence.

41:27.660 --> 41:28.876
Then why did you get him on board?

41:28.900 --> 41:30.060
Keeping him around me

41:30.210 --> 41:31.810
is better than letting him
hide secretly.

41:33.060 --> 41:34.060
Let's wait and see.

41:36.735 --> 41:37.735
Senior,

41:37.785 --> 41:40.160
please do me a favor.

41:40.435 --> 41:41.955
I've done you a lot of favors already.

41:42.360 --> 41:43.360
What is it?

41:43.535 --> 41:45.210
We're arriving at Shangyin Academy.

41:45.385 --> 41:47.635
I don't want others to go ashore.

41:47.659 --> 41:48.885
Please go with me.

41:49.135 --> 41:50.235
In case there are assassins?

41:50.259 --> 41:51.561
My second eldest sister is there.

41:51.585 --> 41:52.734
In her eyes,

41:52.785 --> 41:54.835
my journey must be mischievous.

41:55.635 --> 41:56.715
You're afraid of your sister?

41:56.739 --> 41:57.860
Not me,

41:57.900 --> 41:59.260
but everyone in my family.

42:00.160 --> 42:02.099
When you're around, she might be kinder.

42:02.235 --> 42:04.516
You're the God of Sword, anyway.
She'll show some respect.

42:06.135 --> 42:07.675
Does she beat anyone in your family?

42:07.699 --> 42:08.555
No.

42:08.579 --> 42:09.210
She just...

42:09.560 --> 42:11.035
She just looks fierce.

42:12.735 --> 42:13.319
By the way,

42:13.460 --> 42:14.460
when you see her,

42:14.760 --> 42:17.361
never mention Second Eldest Sister.

42:17.385 --> 42:18.161
Why?

42:18.185 --> 42:19.185
She doesn't like that.

42:19.310 --> 42:20.661
It sounds like she's inferior
to my eldest sister.

42:20.685 --> 42:22.410
What's the point of competing for ages?

42:23.060 --> 42:24.685
Because she's too competitive.

42:25.060 --> 42:26.785
She even competes for ages.

42:29.960 --> 42:31.560
- You got the fish.
- I got it. I got it.

42:31.585 --> 42:32.585
Let's grill it.

43:29.840 --> 43:32.560
♪ The flower of pain ♪

43:34.335 --> 43:37.135
♪ Blooms in my heart ♪

43:39.060 --> 43:41.980
♪ I made a bet with the dawn ♪

43:43.060 --> 43:46.860
♪ That you'll answer ♪

43:48.160 --> 43:51.060
♪ Forgive this tragic end ♪

43:52.760 --> 43:55.580
♪ Moved by the moment we met ♪

43:57.585 --> 44:00.340
♪ In spite of thunder and lightning ♪

44:01.360 --> 44:05.285
♪ In spite of my falling ♪

44:05.785 --> 44:08.516
♪ When we are apart ♪

44:08.540 --> 44:09.780
♪ I'll collapse ♪

44:10.560 --> 44:14.420
♪ Capture an image of the memory ♪

44:15.235 --> 44:17.961
♪ After all these ups and downs ♪

44:17.985 --> 44:19.420
♪ The vanity ♪

44:19.910 --> 44:23.785
♪ Who will open it again ♪

44:24.210 --> 44:25.561
♪ It's worth it ♪

44:25.585 --> 44:28.420
♪ It's enough ♪

44:28.835 --> 44:31.316
♪ Drowned in sadness ♪

44:31.340 --> 44:33.740
♪ Just to see through ♪

44:34.035 --> 44:36.061
♪ I will whisper love to you ♪

44:36.085 --> 44:38.261
♪ For a lifetime ♪

44:38.285 --> 44:42.500
♪ End the worry in the world ♪

44:42.860 --> 44:43.996
♪ It's worth it ♪

44:44.020 --> 44:47.060
♪ I'll be there for you all my life ♪

44:47.235 --> 44:49.196
♪ After the moments of beauty ♪

44:49.220 --> 44:51.940
♪ You are my reason to be ♪

44:52.500 --> 44:54.316
♪ If there is a way ♪

44:54.340 --> 44:56.836
♪ To start over ♪

44:56.860 --> 45:00.960
♪ Will you still remember me ♪
